OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal against failed bid to build
OL,4,A140 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer is appealing against the
OL,7,Frejection of a plan to build 140 homes
OL,8,Fon the edge of a Devon town.
OL,10,FAlmost 600 people objected to the plans
OL,11,Fput forward by Landra Developments Ltd
OL,12,Ffor the houses on fields in Ottery St
OL,13,FMary.
OL,15,FEast Devon District Council planning
OL,16,Fcommittee members refused the plans in
OL,17,FMay, citing concerns ranging from
OL,18,Ftraffic congestion to the impact on the
OL,19,Fsewage system and the loss of
OL,20,Fagricultural land.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
