OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal against failed bid to build
OL,4,A140 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developer is promising 56
OL,7,Faffordable homes as part of the
OL,8,Fdevelopment and says there is good
OL,9,Faccess to the site and a "buffer"
OL,10,Fbetween existing houses on Claremont
OL,11,FField, and the new homes would be part
OL,12,Fof the plans.
